  "post_content": "<p>Esta tarde han continuado en el auditorio de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda las audiciones de alumnos de ense&ntilde;anzas profesionales del Centro de Estudios Musicales.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/05/IMG_6948.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Tras la presentaci&oacute;n a cargo de Vicente Julio Navarro Porcar han ido subiendo al escenario los alumnos para iniciar su interpretaci&oacute;n, empezando por la percusi&oacute;n. Hoy tambi&eacute;n ha sido el turno de violoncelo, flauta y trompeta. Las audiciones seguir&aacute;n, mi&eacute;rcoles y jueves, tambi&eacute;n desde las 19.30 horas, para dar paso al nuevos instrumentos.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6936.jpg\" alt=\"img_6936\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6937.jpg\" alt=\"img_6937\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6938.jpg\" alt=\"img_6938\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6939.jpg\" alt=\"img_6939\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6940.jpg\" alt=\"img_6940\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6941.jpg\" alt=\"img_6941\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6942.jpg\" alt=\"img_6942\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6943.jpg\" alt=\"img_6943\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6944.jpg\" alt=\"img_6944\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6945.jpg\" alt=\"img_6945\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6946.jpg\" alt=\"img_6946\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segondiaaudicionseemm/img_6947.jpg\" alt=\"img_6947\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
